WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.700
The characters on the page came alive. Some of them want you dead.

2
00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:08.200
Beasts flash red before they pounce. Step aside.

3
00:00:08.650 --> 00:00:10.700
Sabers sweep, swords pierce, dagger-axes reach three tiles.

4
00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:13.000
Shoot the Gudiao out of the sky.

5
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:15.700
Zaochi hides behind a shield. Go round it.

6
00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.400
Wherever Bifang lands, false fire burns.

7
00:00:18.850 --> 00:00:21.300
At sea, the Shen rises to ram your boat.

8
00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:26.000
Three great demons, each holding its own ground.

9
00:00:26.450 --> 00:00:29.900
Xiushe coils around your boat.

10
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:34.800
Dafeng tears down houses and uproots trees.

11
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.500
Last of all, Gonggong, who tilted the world: sea,

12
00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:40.600
land,

13
00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:43.700
and sky.

14
00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:47.700
Wishlist now on Steam
